                        "entry_id": "f25fbbd7-f5bf-35b6-858f-78ce58f52e42",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Feeling no dread or fear; unafraid."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf903624-51dc-4659-a211-5bb83b76a24b",
                                "sense_id": "bf89d66b-86db-3d93-984c-a3e1cff8f79b",
                                "text": "So doubly is distrest twixt ioy and cares / The dreadlesse courage of this Elfin knight, / Hauing escapt so sad ensamples in his sight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ecbc5f71-07f2-4c1f-af79-ddcef6d6de2c",
                                "sense_id": "bf89d66b-86db-3d93-984c-a3e1cff8f79b",
                                "text": "And to make shew of his dreadlesse magnanimitie, having caused a pan of burning coales to be brought, he saw and suffred his right arme[…]to be parched and wel-nigh rosted-off[…]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "63f7c52c-e130-3b22-b0e8-0e907112e30a",
                        "entry_id": "f25fbbd7-f5bf-35b6-858f-78ce58f52e42",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Exempt from danger which causes dread; secure."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c218846-c07b-414c-964c-a225949253da",
                                "sense_id": "63f7c52c-e130-3b22-b0e8-0e907112e30a",
                                "text": "Safe in his dreadless den."
                            }
                        ]
